  "body": "The motivated owners are committed to achieving a sale, presenting discerning buyers with an exceptional opportunity to secure this unique property. Now is the time for buyers seeking space for extended family, guest accommodation, home and income potential  or a premium coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nSet on a substantial 1,088sqm (more or less) site in one of Mission Bay's most sought-after streets, this unique property features two completely separate dwellings, creating options rarely found in such a prime location. \r\nThe expansive main residence spans approximately 516sqm and offers four bedrooms, three bathrooms, multiple living areas, two kitchens, an office and generous family spaces across three levels. Whether you're accommodating teenagers, extended family or frequent guests, there's plenty of private and communal spaces for everyone.\r\n\r\nThe separate self-contained guest house provides genuine independence with two bedrooms, bathroom facilities, open- plan living space and dedicated garaging to complete this dwelling. Perfect for grandparents, adult children, visiting guests, work-from-home options or potential rental income. \r\n\r\nOutside, a private swimming pool, established gardens and lawn create the ideal setting for entertaining family and friends.  Secure fencing, extensive storage, five-car internal garaging and ample off-street parking complete the package.  While it is comfortably liveable today, the interiors offer exciting scope for cosmetic enhancement, allowing new owners to add their own style and potentially increase value over time.\r\n\r\nJust moments from Mission Bay beach, waterfront walks, cafes, restaurants and local amenities, this is a property that delivers exceptional flexibility in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal locations. The vendors are committed to achieving a sale and welcome all genuine interest.  Private viewings are welcome - make your offer today.",
